# gameData import discipline

## Rule

Any function called in `game/src/data/gameData.js` **must** appear in the same file's `import` block. Missing imports crash React at runtime (black screen) but pass Vite build.

## Before marking game data work done

```powershell
cd C:\Users\steve\MeWorld\game
node scripts/audit-game-case-load.mjs
node scripts/smoke-test.mjs
npm run dev   # or dev:study — must pass screenshot smoke before telling Steve ready
```

See also **`play-case-smoke.mdc`** — agents must share screenshot paths from `docs/smoke-screenshots/`.

`audit-game-case-load.mjs` loads **every** catalog id (including uber U01–U08) through `getCaseById` → `toGameCase` → `enrichUberGameCase`.

## Uber cases

- Definitions: `src/data/uberCases.json`
- Enrichment: `enrichUberGameCase` in `src/lib/uberCases.js` — **always import** when calling from `gameData.js`
- Smoke: `uber: toGameCase enriches` in `smoke-test.mjs`

## Study vs main

- **Develop:** `C:\Users\steve\MeWorld\game` · `npm run dev:study`
- **Frozen study copy:** `MeWorld-study` — refresh with `scripts\create-study-snapshot.ps1` after fixes; do not edit only study and forget main.
